{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19972","headline":"游枋口 二 · 孟郊","name":"游枋口 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耸我残病骨，健如一仙人。\n镜中照千里，镜浪洞百神。\n此神日月华，不作寻常春。\n三十夜皆明，四时昼恒新。\n鸟声尽依依，兽心亦忻忻。\n澄幽出所怪，闪异坐微絪。\n可来复可来，此地灵相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}